his neighbors are plagued by secrets and struggles that are mysteriously tied to the strange hospital.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Heartwarming and character-rich story.<br></li><li>A unique non-combat adventure that mixes whimsical dungeons, eerie room escape puzzles, and dialogue-based mysteries that are intricately tied to the story.<br></li><li>Walk a mile in everyone's shoes as you traverse each character's life to learn about their unfinished business and help them through it. <br></li><li>An original soundtrack featuring multiple vocal songs that are closely tied to each character. <br></li><li>Collect items and build friendships to gradually make the hospital a better place.<br></li><li>Go on humorous quests for strange creatures in the fantasy world.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/559210/extras/0b6e895735bd8a7c3d17844e83aa8146.avif?t=1680430183\" width=616 height=821 /></span>","developers":["Laura Shigihara"],"dlc":[572910,1331270],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/559210/header.jpg?t=1680430183","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Rakuen 2016 Laura Shigihara","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 or compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon HD 2400<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.6.8<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon HD 2400<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":84,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/rakuen?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://vid